// endpoint_open_login.proto — OpenLogin: begin (or join) the account login
// flow for a workspace's account root. WEB LINK section. THE PTY PATH IS
// THE MECHANISM: the daemon spawns `claude /login` on a daemon-owned pty
// (one per account root; a second open JOINS the running session — the
// open is per-account idempotent) and the client renders the raw bytes in
